      "id": 343106,
      "username": "yogeshvachhani",
      "name": "Yogesh Vachhani",
      "created_at": "2022-10-25T08:13:42.153Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have created a new Virtual Machine in which I have installed:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ubuntu Server 22.04 LTS</li>\n<li>Frappe Framework v14.12.0 (version-14)</li>\n<li>ERPNext v14.3.1 (version-14)</li>\n<li>Payments v0.0.1 (develop)</li>\n<li>Frappe HR v1.0.0 (develop)</li>\n<li>India Compliance v14.0.1 (version-14)</li>\n<li>Frappe Chat v0.0.1 (main)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>All things are working in my primary testing.</p>\n<p>I am sharing with hope that it will help someone who is looking to setup a VM for using or testing ERPNext.</p>\n<p>I have enabled Developer mode.<br>\nSSH is also configured and enabled.</p>\n<p>ERPNext is in the folder called <strong>erp14</strong>.</p>\n<p>If interested please download it from here: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BzoVSJbT1yHgi2InvPUmcF8h11ncaY78/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BzoVSJbT1yHgi2InvPUmcF8h11ncaY78/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p>Login Name is: <strong>self</strong><br>\nPassword is <strong>admin</strong></p>\n<p>MariaDB password is also <strong>admin</strong>.</p>\n<p>Regards,</p>",
