      "name": "Richard Case",
      "created_at": "2022-11-16T14:57:21.999Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As I pointed out <a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/vm-ova-file-of-erpnext-v13-14-ready-to-use/82827/9\">here</a> frappe have withdrawn their official support for their VM:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://erpnext.com/download\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://erpnext.com/download</a></p>\n<p>This is advertised in the v13 github repo README</p>\n<p>It looks like the new officially supported method is a docker deployment, even though this is less widely supported, especially on Windows &amp; Mac, and more difficult to deploy reliably.</p>\n<p>It wouldn’t be official if I did it.</p>",
