      "id": 346056,
      "username": "yogeshvachhani",
      "name": "Yogesh Vachhani",
      "created_at": "2022-11-21T05:33:39.632Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/itsshivam198\">@itsshivam198</a>,</p>\n<p>For installing Ubuntu Server in the VM I followed this guide.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://hibbard.eu/install-ubuntu-virtual-box/\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://hibbard.eu/favicon.ico\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"\" height=\"\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://hibbard.eu/install-ubuntu-virtual-box/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">hibbard.eu</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    \n\n<h3><a href=\"https://hibbard.eu/install-ubuntu-virtual-box/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">How to Install Ubuntu Server on VirtualBox · James Hibbard</a></h3>\n\n  <p>In this post I'll show you how to install Ubuntu Server 22.04 on VirtualBox. I'll also demonstrate how to connect to the Ubuntu instance via SSH.</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>After installing Ubuntu Server in the VM successfully, I followed this guide.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/HUMENTH/Guide-to-Install-Frappe-ERPNext-in-Ubuntu-22.04-LTS\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/favicons/favicon.svg\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/HUMENTH/Guide-to-Install-Frappe-ERPNext-in-Ubuntu-22.04-LTS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GitHub</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/345;\"><img src=\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/c402a6a814436facf4c453d92da42f0be18505c2a14e6a5d243422fa06836a45/HUMENTH/Guide-to-Install-Frappe-ERPNext-in-Ubuntu-22.04-LTS\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"690\" height=\"345\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/HUMENTH/Guide-to-Install-Frappe-ERPNext-in-Ubuntu-22.04-LTS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GitHub - HUMENTH/Guide-to-Install-Frappe-ERPNext-in-Ubuntu-22.04-LTS: A...</a></h3>\n\n  <p>A complete Guide to Install Frappe Bench on Ubuntu 22.04 LTS and install Frappe/ERPNext Application - GitHub - HUMENTH/Guide-to-Install-Frappe-ERPNext-in-Ubuntu-22.04-LTS: A complete Guide to Insta...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>While following the guide the only change that I made was installing NodeJS 14 instead of 16 so that if one requires on can install ERPNext 13 also.</p>\n<p>Regards,</p>",
